 "etapas": [
  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "How they are formed",
     "texto": [
      "They are conjugated like reflexive verbs, but only in the plural: **ci conosciamo** (we know each other), **vi vedete** (you see each other), **si amano** (they love each other).",
      "In the passato prossimo they always use **essere**, and the past participle agrees: **ci siamo conosciuti** / **ci siamo conosciute**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Common verbs",
     "texto": [
      "**vedersi** (to see each other), **scriversi** (to write to each other), **parlarsi** (to talk to each other), **incontrarsi** (to meet), **aiutarsi** (to help each other)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
